---
// TextPhotoCTA.astro - Sharp Industrial SMS Photo Quote Banner
---

<div class="bg-[#0f274a] p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl border-t-4 border-amber-500 border-x border-b border-slate-800 text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 relative overflow-hidden my-10 font-sans">
  
  <div class="flex-1 relative z-10 text-left">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-950 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>Instant Key ID by Photo</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
      Not Sure Which Key or Fob You Have?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-medium">
      Laser cut? Smart proximity fob? Transponder? Don't guess. <strong class="text-amber-400">Text a photo</strong> of your key, lock, or door directly to our technicians for an exact price and prompt ETA.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto flex flex-col items-center">
    <a 
      href="sms:6156258000" 
      class="w-full md:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-black text-sm sm:text-base uppercase tracking-wider shadow-xl active:scale-95 transition-all border-b-2 border-amber-600"
    >
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-950 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z" />
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
      </svg>
      <span>Text Us A Photo Now</span>
    </a>
    <div class="text-center mt-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
      <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
      <span>Direct to On-Duty Master Locksmith &bull; (615) 625-8000</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
